      "value": "@{63bcc942ec37e3449412a4a4|full_name} it would be during the download phase of the world transfer process. The goal is to let users choose a short basic track that changes things up. The normal loading music is very stale nowadays. Also VRChat has already introduced custom loading screens for VRC+ users so that proves that a custom track option could be stitched into the code that already exists regarding custom loading screens/music. I think it has value and EAC would detect harmful files if a user tries to load up an infected mp3. It is abe to check the metadata of such files.",
