  "details": "Imagine if one day from this request that custom loading music was possible for the first time! For example, an MP3 file requirement... since Unity is compatible with this type of file for an audio source. If this post doesn't make it into the game, I would be a little bummed, however this would be a very convenient feature to add under the VRC+ menu section in game. If this makes it to the actual game, I will be ecstatic to try it out! Let's cross our fingers on this one! A cool loading screen track I stitched together myself is linked below as an example. I'll be thrilled to be able to utilize it if this request is released! VVV\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PEePntCY-k0",
